    "fixed_text": "Verified Carbon Standard\n\nPROMOTION OF EV INFRASTRUCTURE AND EMISSION REDUCTION FOR SUSTAINABLE TRANSPORT BY {{company1}} AND {{company2}}\n\nProject title: {{project_title}}\nProject ID: {{project_id}}\nMonitoring period: {{monitoring_start}} to {{monitoring_end}}\nCrediting period: {{crediting_start}} to {{crediting_end}}\nOriginal date of issue: {{issue_date}}\nMost recent date of issue: {{recent_issue_date}}\nVersion: {{version}}\nVCS Standard Version: {{vcs_version}}\nPrepared by: {{prepared_by}}",
